   "w": 846,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Maximum front pocket depth, cm. The short vertical line marks each group's average. Hover a dot for the brand and model."
  },
  {
   "tag": "h2",
   "y": 1143,
   "x": 272,
   "w": 896,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "The gap is in the front, not the back"
  },
  {
   "tag": "p",
   "y": 1192,
   "x": 272,
   "w": 896,
   "in_svg": false,
   "hidden": false,
   "text": "Back pockets are close in size: men's average 16.0 high and 13.7 wide, women's 15.1 high and 13.3 wide. The difference is concentrated in front, where it matters for carrying a phone or keys. In 29 of the 40 women's pairs the front pocket is actually shallower than the back pocket. That never happens in the men's jeans."
  },
